        <mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, the hidden page Ledger Detail, as the model answer is saved: its drill-through filter holds the subtype and no year, so the table lists the loss entry of 2025 and the one of 2026. The amber label is drawn to name that filter; it is not a visual of the page. Outlined: the P&amp;L Amount of each entry, negative because a loss is a debit. The closes do not appear, because P&amp;L Amount leaves them out. Total rows are not drawn, and neither is the page&#x27;s text box with the written answers.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="204" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
